  "goodToKnow": "Der Anker is an anchor: den Anker werfen (to drop anchor), den Anker lichten (to weigh anchor), vor Anker liegen (to lie at anchor). Figuratively, it's something that gives stability: Sie ist mein Anker. Verankern means to anchor or embed: im Gesetz verankert (enshrined in law). Careful: a TV news anchor is not der Anker but der Nachrichtensprecher or Moderator. Anker is also a well-known German bread brand. The plural is the same."
